cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OHMmy in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OHMmy: Streamlined Single-Cell RNA-Seq Analysis and Visualization for Seurat v5"
abstract: >-
  An R toolkit for single-cell RNA sequencing (scRNA-seq) analysis built for
  Seurat v5. It provides reproducible wrappers for ambient RNA decontamination
  with SoupX, normalisation and batch integration, clustering, technical-noise
  diagnostics, publication-ready visualisation, donor-aware statistics, and
  functional enrichment (ORA and GSEA).
